[863.226523, "o", "=== COMPREHENSIVE FILE VERIFICATION ===\r\n\r\n1. WEO_Data Sheet Verification\r\n   Real GDP data (2000, 2010, 2020, 2027):\r\n   2000: GDP=10.8, Growth=8.4%\r\n   2010: GDP=22.6, Growth=3.9%\r\n   2020: GDP=30.1, Growth=-3.6%\r\n   2027: GDP=43.9, Growth=14.9%\r\n\r\n2. PWT Sheet Verification\r\n   Capital Stock (rnna) data:\r\n"]
[863.226668, "o", "   1990: 53800\r\n   2000: 58500\r\n   2010: 93200\r\n   2020: 87200\r\n\r\n3. CFC Data Sheet Verification\r\n   CFC and Depreciation Rate data:\r\n   1996: CFC=450, K_stock_formula=str, DepRate_formula=str\r\n   2001: CFC=620, K_stock_formula=str, DepRate_formula=str\r\n   2006: CFC=970, K_stock_formula=str, DepRate_formula=str\r\n   2016: CFC=950, K_stock_formula=str, DepRate_formula=str\r\n\r\n4. Investment Sheet Verification\r\n   Investment data (2026-2029):\r\n   2026: 648.5893137564417\r\n   2027: 1220.080196896535\r\n   2028: 1756.17368014315\r\n   2029: 2221.194700985215\r\n\r\n5. Production Sheet Key Formulas\r\n   B2 (Capital share): 0.35\r\n   B3 (Avg Depreciation): =AVERAGE(CFC!E22:CFC!E29)\r\n   F6 (LnK formula): =IF(D6>0,LN(D6),\"\")\r\n   G6 (LnY formula): =IF(E6>0,LN(E6),\"\")\r\n"]
[863.226722, "o", "   H6 (LnZ formula): =IF(AND(G6<>\"\",F6<>\"\"),G6-$B$2*F6,\"\")\r\n   E59 (K/Y Anchor): =AVERAGE(D71:D79)\r\n   G62 (Ystar_base): =IF(AND(F62<>\"\",E62<>\"\"),EXP(F62+$B$2*LN(E62)),\"\")\r\n   I62 (K_with): =E62\r\n   J62 (Ystar_with): =IF(AND(F62<>\"\",I62<>\"\"),EXP(F62+$B$2*LN(I62)),\"\")\r\n\r\n6. Summary Section\r\n   Total Investment formula: =SUM(Investment!C2:C9)\r\n   Cumulative Impact formula: =SUM(D91:D108)\r\n   Average Annual Impact formula: =AVERAGE(D91:D108)\r\n\r\n=== VERIFICATION COMPLETE ==="]
[863.226769, "o", "\r\nAll sheets and formulas are in place!\r\nThe Excel file is ready for analysis in LibreOffice Calc or Excel.\r\n"]
